    "name": "The Dark Legacy",
    "steam_appid": 3679470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/b6b77dda4d9c6de5034ff731dd31c469.poster.avif?t=1752708250\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/b6b77dda4d9c6de5034ff731dd31c469.webm?t=1752708250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/b6b77dda4d9c6de5034ff731dd31c469.mp4?t=1752708250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Dark Legacy</strong> is a psychological horror game played from a first-person perspective, where you step into a decaying estate left behind by a man who believed death could be reversed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house belonged to <i>Dr. Victor Halberg</i>, a once-celebrated brain surgeon who spiraled into obsession after the sudden death of his wife. Isolated from the world, he transformed his home into a hidden laboratory, where science crossed into madness and memory refused to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <i>John Halberg</i>, his estranged grandson. Broke and desperate, you return to claim your inheritance \u2014 a crumbling estate lost to time and rumor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple inspection for resale slowly becomes a descent into a forgotten experiment that was never truly abandoned. You uncover scattered records, distorted audio logs, and glimpses of a consciousness that should not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, the house awakens. And the legacy you thought was buried\u2026 remembers you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/52f7d815dd0d72d3b3e88082afb29981.poster.avif?t=1752708250\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/52f7d815dd0d72d3b3e88082afb29981.webm?t=1752708250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/52f7d815dd0d72d3b3e88082afb29981.mp4?t=1752708250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dark Legacy</strong> focuses on exploration, tension, and psychological unease rather than combat. Players freely navigate the decaying estate, solve environmental puzzles, listen to disturbing audio logs, and piece together a fragmented past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step may awaken a memory. Every room hides a secret.<br>And some questions are best left unanswered.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/b6b77dda4d9c6de5034ff731dd31c469.poster.avif?t=1752708250\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/b6b77dda4d9c6de5034ff731dd31c469.webm?t=1752708250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/b6b77dda4d9c6de5034ff731dd31c469.mp4?t=1752708250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Dark Legacy</strong> is a psychological horror game played from a first-person perspective, where you step into a decaying estate left behind by a man who believed death could be reversed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house belonged to <i>Dr. Victor Halberg</i>, a once-celebrated brain surgeon who spiraled into obsession after the sudden death of his wife. Isolated from the world, he transformed his home into a hidden laboratory, where science crossed into madness and memory refused to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <i>John Halberg</i>, his estranged grandson. Broke and desperate, you return to claim your inheritance \u2014 a crumbling estate lost to time and rumor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple inspection for resale slowly becomes a descent into a forgotten experiment that was never truly abandoned. You uncover scattered records, distorted audio logs, and glimpses of a consciousness that should not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, the house awakens. And the legacy you thought was buried\u2026 remembers you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/52f7d815dd0d72d3b3e88082afb29981.poster.avif?t=1752708250\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/52f7d815dd0d72d3b3e88082afb29981.webm?t=1752708250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/52f7d815dd0d72d3b3e88082afb29981.mp4?t=1752708250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dark Legacy</strong> focuses on exploration, tension, and psychological unease rather than combat. Players freely navigate the decaying estate, solve environmental puzzles, listen to disturbing audio logs, and piece together a fragmented past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step may awaken a memory. Every room hides a secret.<br>And some questions are best left unanswered.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Dark Legacy is a first-person psychological horror set in an abandoned surgeon\u2019s home. Every room holds an unfinished experiment. Every wall hides a silenced scream. In a house where death was denied, escape means remembering.",
